---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Copyright and Intellectual Property Policy"
  description="All ashmo.io content is original or licensed. No copying, resale, redistribution, or AI training without written permission."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Copyright"
    highlight="& IP."
    description={`All content is original or licensed. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/contact/', label: 'Request a licence' }}
    secondary={{ href: '/terms/', label: 'Terms of use' }}
    stats={[
      { value: '©', label: 'all rights' },
      { value: 'No AI', label: 'training' },
      { value: 'UAE', label: 'law' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Originality"
    sideTitle="Original frameworks. Personal-use licence for buyers. No AI scraping."
    sideDescription="Covers ownership, permitted use, prohibited use, AI training restrictions, takedown procedure, and infringement reporting."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] space-y-4">
      

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">01 · Ownership</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Ownership</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>All content on ashmo.io — including but not limited to articles, templates, prompts, dashboards, frameworks, courses, videos, graphics, photography, worksheets, Excel sheets, Notion templates, PDFs, downloads, and the design and code of the website itself — is either original work owned by Ashraf Hassan or licensed from third parties with appropriate rights. All rights reserved.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">02 · Buyer Licence</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Buyer Licence</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Where you purchase a digital product, course, template, or workbook, you receive a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable licence to use it for your own business or organisation only. The licence does not transfer ownership.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">03 · Permitted Use</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Permitted Use</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Use within your own organisation, with your direct team.</li>
            <li>Adapt for your own internal operations.</li>
            <li>Reference short excerpts (under 200 words) for fair commentary or review, with clear attribution and a link back to ashmo.io.</li>
            <li>Quote a single chart, framework, or quote in academic, journalistic, or educational work with attribution.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">04 · Prohibited Use</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Prohibited Use</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Without prior written permission, you may <strong>not</strong>:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1 mt-2">
            <li>Copy, reproduce, distribute, or publish substantial portions of the content.</li>
            <li>Resell, redistribute, sublicense, rebrand, translate, or republish content.</li>
            <li>Scrape, mirror, or systematically harvest content.</li>
            <li>Use content to build, train, fine-tune, or evaluate AI models, datasets, prompt libraries, or LLM tools.</li>
            <li>Create derivative products that compete with ashmo.io products.</li>
            <li>Remove copyright notices, attribution, or trademark marks.</li>
            <li>Misrepresent authorship or implied endorsement.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">05 · AI Training and Dataset Use</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">AI Training and Dataset Use</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>The content on ashmo.io is explicitly <strong>not</strong> licensed for use as training data, fine-tuning data, retrieval-augmented generation source material, or for inclusion in any AI training corpus, public or commercial. Robots directives, AI-bot signals, and machine-readable opt-out signals on this site reinforce this position.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">06 · Third-Party Trademarks</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Third-Party Trademarks</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>References to third-party brands, products, or trademarks are for editorial, illustrative, or comparative purposes only. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners. No endorsement or affiliation is implied.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">07 · Takedown and Infringement</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Takedown and Infringement</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If you believe content on this site infringes your copyright or other intellectual property right, contact <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a> with: (a) identification of the work allegedly infringed, (b) the URL of the content on this site, (c) your contact details, and (d) a statement of good-faith belief and authority. We will review and act in good faith.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">08 · Licence Requests</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Licence Requests</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>To request a commercial licence, reprint, translation, syndication, training-data licence, or republication right: <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">09 · Governing Law</p>
          <h2 class="mt-4 font-heading text-[1.55rem] md:text-[1.8rem] font-bold leading-[1.15] text-text">Governing Law</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>This policy is governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates, including Federal Decree-Law No. 38 of 2021 on Copyright and Neighbouring Rights, alongside international IP principles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
